Unbent on your phone is now the whole Unbent site, so everything the website does works here too: selecting several notes at once, auto-fill, custom fields, import and export, and every setting.

Attach a photo straight from the camera. Links to your notes open in the app, and exports save to Downloads.

Back closes whatever is open first. Losing signal no longer signs you out. The Unbent address and version are now under Settings, App settings.